    "rules": [
      "Parallel question/evidence collection is distinct from parallel model inference.",
      "Reuse Intent Scheduler and Capability Assimilation read-only batching instead of creating a second worker authority.",
      "Current hardware/resource policy may evolve only through its rightful source owner."
